<div class="page home"><section class="introduction"><p class="eyebrow">MULTIMEDIA SECURITY & INFORMATION HIDING</p><h1>MALab 多媒体安全</h1><p class="institution">{{ site.institution }}</p><h2>团队简介</h2><p class="intro-text">{{ site.about }}</p><p class="intro-text">我们关注数字内容从生成、传输到使用过程中的安全问题，结合算法、数据集与系统评估，探索真实通信场景下的可信多媒体技术。</p><div class="links"><a href="{{ '/about/' | relative(page.url) }}">了解团队 →</a><a href="{{ '/people/ren-yanzhen/' | relative(page.url) }}">任延珍老师个人主页 →</a></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-title"><h2>研究方向</h2><a href="{{ '/research/' | relative(page.url) }}">查看研究方向 →</a></div><div class="directions">{% for d in site.directions %}<article class="direction"><p class="eyebrow">{{ d.subtitle }}</p><h3><a href="{{ ('/research/#' + d.id) | relative(page.url) }}">{{ d.title }} ↗</a></h3><p>{{ d.description }}</p><ul>{% for topic in d.topics %}<li>{{ topic }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul></article>{% endfor %}</div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-title"><h2>近期重点成果</h2><a href="{{ '/publications/' | relative(page.url) }}">全部论文 →</a></div><p class="section-intro">聚焦近期公开工作，介绍研究问题、方法与可复现资源。</p>{% set items = collections.featured %}{% include 'cards.njk' %}</section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-title"><h2>开放资源</h2><a href="{{ '/resources/' | relative(page.url) }}">查看全部资源 →</a></div><p class="intro-text">从真实通话中的伪造检测，到语音编辑定位与音视频识别，我们公开了相关数据集和研究代码。每个项目均说明研究内容与资源用途，方便选择和复现。</p><div class="resource-preview">{% for item in collections.resources %}<a href="{{ ('/resources/#' + item.page.fileSlug) | relative(page.url) }}"><strong>{{ item.data.resourceName }}</strong><span>{{ item.data.summary }}</span></a>{% endfor %}</div></section></div>